  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM4.9.3">
<l>karuḷuṭaiya poḻilmarutuṅ katakkaḷiṟum</l>
<l rend="indent">pilampaṉaiyuṅ kaṭiya māvum</l>
<l>uruḷuṭaiya cakaṭaṉaiyum mallaraiyum</l>
<l rend="indent">uṭaiyaviṭ ṭōcai kēṭṭāṉ</l>
<l>iruḷakaṟṟu meṟikatirōṉ maṇṭalattū</l>
<l rend="indent">ṭēṟṟivait tēṇi vāṅki</l>
<l>aruḷkoṭuttiṭ ṭaṭiyavarai yāṭkoḷvā</l>
<l rend="indent">ṉamarumū raṇiya raṅkamē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>Having appeared in order to destroy</l>
<l rend="indent">the Marutu trees in the dark grove,</l>
<l rend="indent">the angry elephant, Pralamba, the cruel horse,</l>
<l rend="indent">the [demon disguised as] the wheeled cart,</l> 
<l rend="indent">and the wrestlers,</l>
<l>He heard cheers.</l>
<l>The city where dwells he who,</l>
<l rend="indent">raising [his] servants up through</l>
<l rend="indent">the realm of the fiery sun that dispells the darkness,</l>
<l rend="indent">removing the ladder, and bestowing grace [upon them],</l>
<l rend="indent">accepts [them] as servants,</l>
<l>is beautiful Araṅkam.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
